## Features [![demo](https://camo.githubusercontent.com/470dcc79497ac8dd797d35a7c485df0f3c3635cb823f82e0118b862869b538c0/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f6c6976652d64656d6f2d627269676874677265656e2e737667)](https://mehmet-kozan.github.io/pdf-parse/)

[](#features-)

*   CJS, ESM, Node.js, and browser support.
*   Can be integrated with `React`, `Vue`, `Angular`, or any other web framework.
*   **Command-line interface** for quick PDF processing: [`CLI Documentation`](/mehmet-kozan/pdf-parse/blob/main/docs/command-line.md)
*   [`Security Policy`](https://github.com/mehmet-kozan/pdf-parse?tab=security-ov-file#security-policy)
*   Retrieve headers and validate PDF: [`getHeader()`](#getheader--node-utility-pdf-header-retrieval-and-validation)
*   Extract document info: [`getInfo()`](#getinfo--extract-metadata-and-document-information)
*   Extract page text: [`getRaw() getText() getParagraph()`](#gettext--extract-text)
*   Render pages as PNG: [`getScreenshot()`](#getscreenshot--render-pages-as-png)
*   Extract embedded images: [`getImage()`](#getimage--extract-embedded-images)
*   Detect and extract tabular data: [`getTable()`](#gettable--extract-tabular-data)
*   See [LoadParameters](/mehmet-kozan/pdf-parse/blob/main/docs/options.md#load-parameters) and [ParseParameters](/mehmet-kozan/pdf-parse/blob/main/docs/options.md#parse-parameters) for all available options.
*   Examples: [`live demo`](/mehmet-kozan/pdf-parse/blob/main/reports/demo), [`examples`](/mehmet-kozan/pdf-parse/blob/main/examples), [`tests`](/mehmet-kozan/pdf-parse/blob/main/tests/unit) and [`tests example`](/mehmet-kozan/pdf-parse/blob/main/tests/unit/test-example) folders.
*   Supports: [`Next.js + Vercel`](https://github.com/mehmet-kozan/vercel-next-app-demo), Netlify, AWS Lambda, Cloudflare Workers.

## Installation

[](#installation)

npm install pdf-parse
# or
pnpm add pdf-parse
# or
yarn add pdf-parse
# or
bun add pdf-parse

### CLI Installation

[](#cli-installation)

For command-line usage, install the package globally:

# installation
npm install -g pdf-parse

# updating
npm update -g pdf-parse

# uninstallation
npm uninstall -g pdf-parse

# help
pdf-parse -h

For detailed CLI documentation and usage examples, see: [CLI Documentation](/mehmet-kozan/pdf-parse/blob/main/docs/command-line.md)

## Usage

[](#usage)

### `getHeader` — Node Utility: PDF Header Retrieval and Validation

[](#getheader--node-utility-pdf-header-retrieval-and-validation)

// Important: getHeader is available from the 'pdf-parse/node' submodule
import { getHeader } from 'pdf-parse/node';

